   "id": 0,
   "en": "{09 01 00}{09 08 00}Oh, hey,{ff 00 00 06}{01 00 00 05 00} {04 10 00}{ff 00 00 00},{01 00 00 0f 00} it's\nquiz time,{01 00 00 05 00} {04 02 00}!\n\n{07 14 00}{0b 03 00}{04 13 00},\n{04 11 00}, or \n{04 12 00}{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.\n{07 0b 00}Which of these things is\nnot like the others,\n{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}?{09 09 00}",
