   "en": "{09 01 00}{09 08 00}{07 16 00}Lately,{01 00 00 05 00} when I've been\nspacing out on my couch...\n\n{07 09 00}I start to draw pictures of\n{04 13 00} before I\nrealize it{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.\n{07 16 00}Do you think this{01 00 00 05 00} is a sign\nof something,{01 00 00 05 00} {04 02 00}?{09 09 00}",
   "et": "{09 01 00}{09 08 00}{07 16 00}Viimasel ajal,{01 00 00 05 00} kui olen\ndiivanil mõtteis...\n\n{07 09 00}hakkan enne kui arugi saan\njoonistama pilte\n{04 13 00}-st{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.\n{07 16 00}Kas see{01 00 00 05 00} on mingi märk\nmillestki,{01 00 00 05 00} {04 02 00}?{09 09 00}"
