  {
   "id": 3,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{09 06 00}{07 15 00}Hey!{01 00 00 05 00}{01 00 00 05 00} {0b 03 00}{ff 00 00 06}{04 0f 00}{ff 00 00 00}!{01 01 00} Are you{01 00 00 05 00}\nseriously trying to make me\ntake a quiz, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}?{09 09 00}",
   "et": "{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{09 06 00}{07 15 00}Hei!{01 00 00 05 00}{01 00 00 05 00} {0b 03 00}{ff 00 00 06}{04 0f 00}{ff 00 00 00}!{01 01 00} Kas sa{01 00 00 05 00}\ntõsiselt üritad panna mind\nviktoriini tegema, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}?{09 09 00}"
