  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "en": "{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 01 00}I'm asking you if you're\nserious about which of\nthese things is different!\n{07 15 00}'Cause lemme tell you{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00} If\nthis is some kind of\ncontest, I'll put up a fight!\n{07 05 00}But if it's just pickin' on\nlittle weaklings,{01 00 00 05 00} I'll HATE it!\n\n{07 15 00}{0b 03 00}{04 1f 00}{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{09 04 00} Are you gonna\nlet this fly,{01 00 00 05 00} {04 02 00}?{09 01 00}{09 04 00}{09 02 00}{02 00 00 06 08}\nNever!\nLet what fly?",
   "et": "{09 00 00}{09 08 00}{09 02 00}{07 01 00}Ma küsin, kas sa oled\ntõsine selles, milline neist\nasjadest on teistsugune!\n{07 15 00}Sest las ma ütlen{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00} Kui\nsee on mingi võistlus,\nsiis ma võitlen!\n{07 05 00}Aga kui narritakse lihtsalt\nnõrgemaid,{01 00 00 05 00} siis VIHKAN!\n\n{07 15 00}{0b 03 00}{04 1f 00}{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}{09 04 00} Kas sa lased\nsel nii minna,{01 00 00 05 00} {04 02 00}?{09 01 00}{09 04 00}{09 02 00}{02 00 00 06 08}\nMitte iial!\nMillel minna?"
